(7611829, 1231769, 67145, '<td valign="top">awwwwwww .. cute as .. !! .. really like the way the person''s hand is cupping the dog''s .. protective .. this is lovely .. :)</td>', 'awwwwwww .. cute as .. !! .. really like the way the person''s hand is cupping the dog''s .. protective .. this is lovely .. :)', '2019-02-01 14:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7611834, 1231917, 67145, '<td valign="top">i''m not a huge fan of the woodies .. but when the photographer is able to inject some emotion or personality into the mix .. then thats awesome .. <br/>and this is awesome .. what a great photo for the challenge .. <br/>what i particularly like about this is the slant of the woody''s head .. it makes me smile .. and it communicates a real human feeling .. like .. a bit hesitant, possibly awestruck and anxious .. the body and chest pushed forward .. shows a bit more assertiveness .. <br/>so thats what i''ve got out of a piece of wood .. well done for creating life from something inanimate .. :)</td>', 'i''m not a huge fan of the woodies .. but when the photographer is able to inject some emotion or personality into the mix .. then thats awesome .. and this is awesome .. what a great photo for the challenge .. what i particularly like about this is the slant of the woody''s head .. it makes me smile .. and it communicates a real human feeling .. like .. a bit hesitant, possibly awestruck and anxious .. the body and chest pushed forward .. shows a bit more assertiveness .. so thats what i''ve got out of a piece of wood .. well done for creating life from something inanimate .. :)', '2019-02-01 14:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
